    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "PolarDBDiskUsage",
      "help_en": "The performance metrics to query. Separate multiple metrics with commas (,). For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/141787.html.\n\nYou can query a maximum of five performance metrics.\n\nIf your cluster has Serverless enabled for fixed specifications, querying PolarDBCPU or PolarDBMemory alone ignores the Interval parameter and returns performance metrics per second. To get data at your specified Interval, query multiple metrics",
